    ✕  api — deploy failed (exit 124)
    Log: /p/.muster/logs/api-deploy.log

    Likely cause: The api hook ran longer than its 2s deploy_timeout and was
    stopped (exit 124).
    Try: If the deploy is just slow, raise deploy_timeout for this service
    in muster.json.
    More: https://getmuster.dev/docs/troubleshooting#deploy-timeout

    Fix available: Raise api deploy_timeout to 4s

